      "findings": "Junip 7540631, customer 202931541, 2025-03-22: SS is lightweight, refreshing, fast-drying and very hydrating without clogged-pore feeling, useful before makeup. Ordered SS after sister introduction. Seeking greater nighttime hydration/repair prompted Buffer Jelly purchase; reports glowing/clean morning skin and tiny amount needed. Also bought face wash (reports hydration, makeup removal and no more breakouts) and mesh moisturizer immediately on release; enjoys packaging colors. These other-product outcomes are not SS corroboration. Combo+sensitive metadata; SS Refill target does not prove narrated refill/repurchase or formula. Credited origin; votes 0/0 observed 2025-03-23T19:29:50.304Z."
